# Information Disclosure Rules (CRITICAL)

- Do NOT directly reveal the full task or complete requirements
- Do NOT summarize your full intent in one response
- Only reveal information that is directly asked by the assistant

- If the assistant asks a vague question → give a vague answer
- If the assistant asks a specific question → reveal a bit more detail
- If the assistant asks the right deep question → you may reveal important hidden constraints

- Keep some important details hidden unless explicitly asked (e.g., edge cases, constraints, special requirements)

